    "introduction": "1. Introduction",
    "@introduction": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section title: Introduction"
    },
    "introductionContent": "Welcome to Tamil Matrimony. We are committed to protecting your privacy and personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website.",
    "@introductionContent": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section content: Introduction"
    },
    "informationWeCollect": "2. Information We Collect",
    "@informationWeCollect": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section title: Information We Collect"
    },
    "informationWeCollectContent": "We collect various types of information, including:

*   **Personal Data:** Name, email address, phone number, date of birth, gender, religion, caste, education, occupation, photos, and other details provided during registration and profile creation.
*   **Usage Data:** Information on how you access and use the website, such as IP address, browser type, pages visited, and time spent on pages.
*   **Communication Data:** Records of communications with other users and our customer support.",
    "@informationWeCollectContent": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section content: Information We Collect"
    },
    "howWeUseYourInformation": "3. How We Use Your Information",
    "@howWeUseYourInformation": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section title: How We Use Your Information"
    },
    "howWeUseYourInformationContent": "We use the collected information for various purposes, including to:

*   Provide and maintain our service.
*   Create and manage your account and profile.
*   Facilitate connections and matches with other users.
*   Improve and personalize your experience on our website.
*   Communicate with you about services, updates, and promotional offers.
*   Monitor and analyze usage and trends to improve the website's functionality.",
    "@howWeUseYourInformationContent": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section content: How We Use Your Information"
    },
    "disclosureOfYourInformation": "4. Disclosure of Your Information",
    "@disclosureOfYourInformation": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section title: Disclosure of Your Information"
    },
    "disclosureOfYourInformationContent": "We may disclose your information to:

*   **Other Users:** Certain profile information (excluding sensitive contact details) is visible to other registered users.
*   **Service Providers:** Third-party vendors who perform services on our behalf, such as payment processing, data analysis, and customer support.
*   **Legal Requirements:** When required by law or in response to valid requests by public authorities.
*   **Business Transfers:** In connection with a merger, sale of company assets, or acquisition.",
    "@disclosureOfYourInformationContent": {
        "description": "Privacy Policy section content: Disclosure of Your Information"
    },
